# Statistical Learning

*An Introduction to Statistical Learning*

## Foreword

This repository covers the landmark textbook written by
Gareth James, Daniela Witten, Trevor Hastie, Robert Tibshirani,
and Jonathan Taylor. The purpose of this repository is to build
from scracth using `NumPy` fundamental machine learning models.
